      "side": 1,
      "message": "Which branch are you refering to? For example, I see crrev/c/3730445 cherry-picked to only dedede and brya but those branches are sync\u0027ed to ToT. So, there is no cherry-pick conflicts.\n\nCherry-picking this many CLs to a branch would be a lot of work. Separating them per file doesn\u0027t make it particularly easier, I believe. Besides, weren\u0027t these formated automatically by clang-format? I wonder why we didn\u0027t simply run clang-format for all the files per branch.",
      "parentUuid": "75279356_484f14bd",
      "revId": "6f5c8ba36ebf6e96ea4ea4cb4f0458c1c4767d11",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
